<body>
<h1 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 16.1px 0.0px; font: 24.0px Times; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000"><span class="s1"><b>A Short History of Talking Machines</b></span></h1>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1">Speech synthesis is the artificial production of human speech. A computer system used for this purpose is called a speech synthesizer.</span></p>
<h2 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 14.9px 0.0px; font: 18.0px Times; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000"><span class="s1"><b>Early machines</b></span></h2>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1">Long before electronic signal processing, inventors built machines that imitated the human voice with bellows, reeds and leather tubes.</span></p>
<ul class="ul1">
  <li class="li4"><span class="s2"></span><span class="s1">The acoustic-mechanical speech machine of the eighteenth century.</span></li>
  <li class="li4"><span class="s2"></span><span class="s1">The Voder, shown at the 1939 World's Fair.</span></li>
</ul>
<h2 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 14.9px 0.0px; font: 18.0px Times; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000"><span class="s1"><b>语音合成</b></span></h2>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1">语音合成是通过机械的、电子的方法产生人造语音的技术。它把文字转换成可以听懂的声音。</span></p>
<ol class="ol1">
  <li class="li4"><span class="s2"></span><span class="s1">第一步，分析文本。</span></li>
  <li class="li4"><span class="s2"></span><span class="s1">第二步，生成波形。</span></li>
</ol>
<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td valign="middle" class="td1">
        <p class="p4"><span class="s1">Concatenative synthesis joins recorded units.</span></p>
      </td>
      <td valign="middle" class="td2">
        <p class="p4"><span class="s1">Neural synthesis generates the waveform.</span></p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<h2 style="margin: 0.0px 0.0px 14.9px 0.0px; font: 18.0px Times; -webkit-text-stroke: #000000"><span class="s1"><b>References</b></span></h2>
<p class="p2"><span class="s1">A reference that is not read aloud.</span></p>
